{"id":4823,"date":"2025-07-26T08:11:04","date_gmt":"2025-07-26T08:11:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4823"},"modified":"2025-08-28T09:24:46","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T02:24:46","slug":"cach-xem-video-da-xem-tren-tiktok-cuc-don-gian","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-xem-video-da-xem-tren-tiktok-cuc-don-gian\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch xem video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok c\u1ef1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Qi4kdqhxfoiEm0xykuglje61gGg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AnctdMjOEod80dxnuDClzL4wgkh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e3 bao gi\u1edd b\u1ea1n l\u01b0\u1edbt TikTok v\u00e0 g\u1eb7p m\u1ed9t video hay nh\u01b0ng qu\u00ean l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i? Ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n chia s\u1ebb l\u1ea1i cho b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng nh\u1edb r\u00f5 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n hay ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 video? \u0110\u1eebng lo, TikTok \u0111\u00e3 t\u00edch h\u1ee3p t\u00ednh n\u0103ng L\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem (Watch History) gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng t\u00ecm l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video m\u00ecnh t\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1edbt qua ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n. Trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u2013 d\u00f9 b\u1ea1n d\u00f9ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i hay m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q4S6dzEbLo4aSNxvTLRl266Sg1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-RQeRdMdQYoDg3FxhbmxlBnRpgvK\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4005\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4005\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4005\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24.png\" alt=\"Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng truy c\u1eadp to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 video \u0111\u00e3 xem theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0y\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4005\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng truy c\u1eadp to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 video \u0111\u00e3 xem theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0y<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OwLNdiTpGo3mRgxCneflVgKwgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n t\u1eeb TikTok, th\u00ec t\u00ednh n\u0103ng Watch History (L\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem) l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn nhanh v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video t\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1edbt qua. T\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qp0admfxro4HtTxcsVslu5ySgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Xem l\u1ea1i to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 video \u0111\u00e3 xem trong m\u1ee5c D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n (For You).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FWKRd8Z7doYz6hxuBWGlihezg9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ng\u00e0y, gi\u1edd c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 xem m\u1ed7i video.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7ZtdQQr5oVNyyxKYollWBjFgFe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn x\u00f3a t\u1eebng video ho\u1eb7c to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MlZjdtIgSoUiDex5j2ulqCR8gTd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.1. C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok b\u1eb1ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EkTKd0RabowQ4ZxuFyplIxtcg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok c\u00f3 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng L\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem (Watch History) gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n xem l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1edbt qua trong v\u00f2ng 7 ng\u00e0y (n\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eadt t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fe1BdIJ7eodOhrxZYekl2cQXgTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbVvdT9HSoiU69xmh8TlEm7xgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok \u2192 v\u00e0o H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 (g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbVvdT9HSoiU69xmh8TlEm7xgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u2261 (ba g\u1ea1ch) g\u00f3c tr\u00ean ph\u1ea3i \u2192 ch\u1ecdn C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbVvdT9HSoiU69xmh8TlEm7xgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Cu\u1ed9n xu\u1ed1ng \u2192 ch\u1ecdn Trung t\u00e2m ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng (Activity Center).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbVvdT9HSoiU69xmh8TlEm7xgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c L\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem (Watch History).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbVvdT9HSoiU69xmh8TlEm7xgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: TikTok s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb danh s\u00e1ch video b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng xem.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4826\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4826\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4826\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4826\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XmjRdjLCZoQCnPxtIGElKDBeg0f\"><strong>1.2. C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok b\u1eb1ng m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQsGdU2ZAoH2G5xZFiol5dVOgLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n TikTok tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t kh\u00f4ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp xem l\u1ecbch s\u1eed \u0111\u00e3 xem, nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1eb9o sau:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VDmRd2cDIobRX8xdJ8LlLNXagOh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch l\u00e0m:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh qua tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t \u2192 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WILPd7gXZox17CxMlEGlamKDg7e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3Gddzeqlo2b2UxuBnfll43LgDh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: V\u00e0o H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n (avatar) \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i, ch\u1ecdn \u201cXem h\u1ed3 s\u01a1\u201d (View profile) t\u1eeb menu x\u1ed5 xu\u1ed1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wvyjdf5cJoZ5ZQxFmiTlpkndgvd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4824\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4824\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4824\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3.png\" alt=\"Xem l\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4824\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Xem l\u1ecbch s\u1eed xem tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Xem video \u0111\u00e3 th\u00edch \u2192\u00a0 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o tab \u201c\u0110\u00e3 th\u00edch\u201d (bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00e1i tim). T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ea5m &#8220;th\u00edch&#8221; \u2013 \u0111\u00e2y c\u0169ng th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng video b\u1ea1n t\u1eebng xem tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4825\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4825\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4825\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2.png\" alt=\"nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o tab \u201c\u0110\u00e3 th\u00edch\u201d\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4825\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o tab \u201c\u0110\u00e3 th\u00edch\u201d<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7vOdT7PqovhFExxXM2lYBxjg6g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-YBFCd9AY0okt11xTzull9xxKgPh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dnx8d6ZUVoiivaxdX0olZgLvgxc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eadt t\u00ednh n\u0103ng Watch History, TikTok s\u1ebd ghi l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video b\u1ea1n t\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1edbt qua. Ngo\u00e0i vi\u1ec7c xem th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u1ecdc theo ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm theo t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 r\u00fat ng\u1eafn th\u1eddi gian t\u00ecm video:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ay43dxHTWoLMYSxHAwzle1uegSc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: V\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm (k\u00ednh l\u00fap) tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SrVvd8mCfo5MRKxhJ4NlRqhjg2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1eadp t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn video b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u00ecm (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u201cm\u00f3n \u0103n H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c\u201d, \u201cm\u1eb9o h\u1ecdc IELTS\u201d, v.v.)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4829\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4829\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4829 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4829\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1 v\u00e0 B\u01b0\u1edbc 2 b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PghIdeLqRo0pHPxnnuTlR9AUgHS\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1ea1i trang k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u1edf g\u00f3c ph\u1ea3i ph\u00eda tr\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdMxdpZCDoSejYxwiihlz5Mhggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Trong ph\u1ea7n b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc, b\u1eadt t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn \u201c\u0110\u00e3 xem\u201d (Watched) \u2192 TikTok s\u1ebd ch\u1ec9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c video b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng xem c\u00f3 ch\u1ee9a t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4830\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4830\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4830 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4830\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3 v\u00e0 B\u01b0\u1edbc 4 b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzPpdjX7HoPP40xFHahlqepOgof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Ue58dupPmouwKbxvlixlz7Cegyf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch xem l\u1ea1i video \u0111\u00e3 xem \u0111\u00e3 tim tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UtjvdtL47oSzZUxvVcjlWIBsgAd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QrqOdxoVTo8QI9xB7HYlMrpLgLk\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 (avatar) \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AcN0dKXJdoeNsFxYOPMlB5Q3guc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Trong trang h\u1ed3 s\u01a1, ch\u1ecdn tab c\u00f3 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00e1i tim \u2014 \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 n\u01a1i l\u01b0u t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 video b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 &#8220;th\u1ea3 tim&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4828\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4828\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4828\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12.png\" alt=\"Xem l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video m\u00ecnh t\u1eebng xem v\u00e0 th\u1ea3 tim (\u0111\u00e3 th\u00edch) tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-12-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4828\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Xem l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c video m\u00ecnh t\u1eebng xem v\u00e0 th\u1ea3 tim (\u0111\u00e3 th\u00edch) tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Qi4kdqhxfoiEm0xykuglje61gGg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmzXd9LhroHS4ixBz4KlEJMRgLf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu tab tr\u00e1i tim c\u00f3 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u1ed5 kh\u00f3a, ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 danh s\u00e1ch n\u00e0y \u0111ang \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ri\u00eang t\u01b0 v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 b\u1ea1n m\u1edbi xem \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S54HdTNAhoO7EFxXzxlljxNng7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 g\u1ee1 &#8220;tim&#8221; kh\u1ecfi video, n\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong danh s\u00e1ch n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GMXCdTLBQo9A2mxldexlTEcxgOh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<di